          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Your machine is not an orphan. It is a <strong class="text-white">Johnson Health Tech
            treadmill with a discontinued badge</strong>, built by the company that still makes
            Horizon and Matrix, and that single fact turns most LiveStrong repairs from impossible
            into ordinary.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Repair belts, decks, rollers, keys and wiring without hesitation. Think hard about console
            boards, and take the free donor machine when it appears.
